# Environment variables (Development Document §3.1)
# The MVP data layer ships with a local file-backed store so the app runs
# with zero external credentials. When these are provided, the repository
# modules can be pointed at the managed services described in the
# Architecture document (MongoDB Atlas + Cloudinary) without changing the
# API contract.

# --- Optional: MongoDB Atlas (Architecture §9) ---
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster>.mongodb.net/preview-platform

# --- Optional: Cloudinary image storage (Architecture §8) ---
# CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
# CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
# CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=

# --- Local (set automatically with safe defaults if omitted) ---
# SESSION_SECRET=change-me-in-production
# SHARE_TOKEN_SECRET=change-me-in-production
# APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
# SMP_DATA_DIR=./data
